    "Set kp to 2.6 and kd to 0.9, the iteration 5 values (best raced score 699.16), and set ki to 0.10. Keep base_speed 1.2, sensor_weights and line_loss 'last_direction' unchanged. Iteration 6 (kp 2.4) raised no slalom finishes and gave max_error 0.0632, against 0.0634 at iteration 5.",
    "Keep all geometry as in iterations 5 and 6 (sensor y 0.06, x ±0.03 spaced 0.015, sensor_size 0.016, mass 0.6, wheel_track 0.12, wheel_radius 0.03). Iteration 1 showed wider coverage cut bend line losses (1.75 to 1.05 on the slalom), and iteration 2 showed the forward shift and mass change helped, so do not revisit geometry until the slalom finishes at least once.",
